WEBVTT

00:16:57.414 --> 00:17:00.225
so everybody believes
the values are the same.

00:17:00.249 --> 00:17:01.842
And they're intensely held,

00:17:01.866 --> 00:17:04.567
so people are extremely
passionate about them.

00:17:04.591 --> 00:17:07.704
My sense was that WeWork
had a very strong culture.

00:17:07.728 --> 00:17:09.869
First question is
do you agree or disagree,

00:17:09.893 --> 00:17:12.593
and then secondly,
how would you describe the culture?

00:17:14.048 --> 00:17:17.647
DF: I think WeWork had
an incredibly strong culture.

00:17:18.728 --> 00:17:21.139
I think people felt
very connected to the mission,

00:17:21.163 --> 00:17:24.396
I think they felt
very connected to the values.

00:17:26.338 --> 00:17:30.911
So in that sense the culture
was incredibly strong.